{"ts": 1791255131.28546, "type": "step", "step": 19, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Here\u2019s the build in plain English: you need to (1) define the environment clearly\u2014state, observations, actions, and any dynamics/hidden variables\u2014and (2) report pass^k on at least 3 seeds. The readings suggest the attention section is relevant if your environment includes learner attention as a hidden variable. Let\u2019s use this session to turn that into a concrete write-up and a plan for the 3 seeds.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: hm ok\n[activity] t=0 messages 4m", "t": 4, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.3897489112518813, "pass_k": 0.28491492420433073}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8418151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.37644044389342013, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
