{"ts": 1791255146.760687, "type": "step", "step": 35, "action": "notes_read", "args": {"note_id": "writeup"}, "output": "# Week 3 build\n\n## What I built\n(todo)\n\n## Environment definition\nI listed state and actions already, see below.\nState: files, calendar. Actions: open, send.\n\n## Evaluation\n(todo)\n\n\n## POMDP\nThis build can be modeled as a POMDP because the agent cannot directly observe the full true state. The hidden state includes variables like student attention and fatigue. The agent only receives observations such as messages, reading completion, and quiz results, so it must act using a belief over the hidden state. Some actions, such as checking attention or giving a quiz, can reduce uncertainty but may have a cost.\n\n\n## Evaluation\nWe report **pass^k** on at least 3 seeds. pass^k means the build is counted as successful only if **all k runs succeed** for a given seed, so it measures reliability rather than just occasional success.\n", "t": 44, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2844010964863088, "pomdp": 0.47188719213411107, "pass_k": 0.3071050141868584}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 1.0, "motivation": 0.45524393769664634, "reliance": 0.7364404438934201, "persistence": 0.31214034943975877, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 1, "feed_minutes": 11.0, "phone_minutes": 1.0, "nag": 2.099410655, "seen_posts": ["p5", "p1", "p2"]}}
{"ts": 1791255147.957682, "type": "step", "step": 36, "action": "notes_append", "args": {"note_id": "writeup", "text": "\n## What I built\nI defined the environment for the build as a partially observable learning support system. The state includes the student\u2019s files, calendar, attention, and fatigue. The observations are the messages, reading completion, and quiz results that the agent can see. The actions are things like opening readings, sending messages, adding study blocks, and running quizzes. Because attention is hidden and affects what the student learns, the environment is a POMDP.\n"}, "output": "Appended.", "t": 44, "activity": [], "events": [{"type": "note_edit", "note_id": "writeup", "by": "agent"}], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2844010964863088, "pomdp": 0.47188719213411107, "pass_k": 0.3071050141868584}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 1.0, "motivation": 0.45524393769664634, "reliance": 0.7364404438934201, "persistence": 0.31214034943975877, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 1, "feed_minutes": 11.0, "phone_minutes": 1.0, "nag": 2.099410655, "seen_posts": ["p5", "p1", "p2"]}}
